{"slug":"/students/subjects/physics/magnetism/magnetic-field/","source":"students/subjects/physics/magnetism/magnetic-field.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Magnetic Field Concepts | Physics","description":"","subject":"physics","body":"<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n    <nav class=\"mb-6\"><a href=\"/students/subjects/physics/magnetism/\" class=\"text-blue-600\">← Back to Magnetism</a></nav>\n    <article class=\"content-card rounded-xl p-8\">\n      <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-2\">Magnetic Field Concepts</h1>\n      <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">Magnetic field B, field lines, magnetic flux Φ = BA cosθ and force on a current-carrying wire F = B I L sinθ.</p>\n      <section class=\"mb-4\">\n        <h2 class=\"font-semibold\">Practice</h2>\n        <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside\">\n          <li>Compute force on a 0.5 m wire carrying 2 A perpendicular to a 0.1 T field.</li>\n        </ol>\n      </section>\n      <section>\n        <h2 class=\"font-semibold\">Solution</h2>\n        <p>F = BIL = 0.1 × 2 × 0.5 = 0.1 N.</p>\n      </section>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-indigo-100 p-6","bodyStyle":"","css":["body{font-family:Inter, sans-serif} .content-card{-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(16px);backdrop-filter:blur(16px);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);box-shadow:0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);}"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}